  "content": "Okay, I will follow the instructions. Here is the translated content:\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5db75cde-773d-4709-ace4-d2517af73116.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vestiges-of-the-present\" width=\"204\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">支援模组：</span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5;font-size:16px;display:inline !important\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvestiges.pyding.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1fff64_c6708d3c3a52425d8ad4c3fc07220109~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vestiges-of-the-present\" width=\"82\" height=\"82\"></a></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/8HjGaRrMgf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 頻道</a></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">我的模组添加了来自未知强大生物的挑战，这些挑战将通过传说进程来揭示。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">挑战</span>与你模组包中的任何模组兼容，并解决了模组包中最难的问题之一 - 平衡。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">有些模组可能过于强大而廉价，有些可能没用但值得花时间投入，有了我的<span style=\"color:#f00\">挑战</span>,两者都需要进行进展，这给了它们一个以宝贵奖励推进的理由 - <span style=\"color:#c9f\">遗迹。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">你将从传说中知道<span style=\"color:#c9f\">遗迹</span>是什么，但简要地说，它们是用于PVP和PVE的强大工具，让你能完成其他模组做不到的事情。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">我模组中的物品列表：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_1e2241e0-433f-4798-b052-681adb42a280.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1;font-size:36px\">遗迹示例：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_fa1296ad-8638-4823-bd32-8abff215fdee.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_02b9a7eb-5caa-476b-a308-b3c8de8541c7.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_a6e132eb-79aa-4550-a523-e2a41d37bdf2.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">提供了一个<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">全<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">球<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">领<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">导</span></span></span>e<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">板</span></span></span>（当前冻结）系统，包含所有遵守规则并拥有互联网访问权的玩家。排行榜在任何世界都可用，无论是单机模式还是服务器模式！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_70c1659c-39d8-4831-b350-1f8fbb62dbf9.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_28fbd10f-844d-4d7c-a08d-c1f2addc6510.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">一些挑战的示例：你也可以通过按下 Ctrl/Alt 在 NEI 中查看</span></strong></span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_8145639c-1563-4a16-bf2f-c9328ffd6098.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_ea4732ab-ee2b-47be-a3f6-4496208bbc3d.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_3bdeb334-5054-4585-922f-219f3325772b.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_4c0ffe8c-042e-450d-9351-2a1b56e41a16.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5e65600d-7624-4e55-85a6-717a3f477fb7.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">我的<span style=\"color:#169179\">神秘<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">圣物</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">宝库：</span></span></span></strong></span></span></h2>\n<p>当你获得进展或完成任何挑战时，你有一定几率可以获得它们。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5c7be93d-57b6-4d59-a3c3-1ce2ceb72b01.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_1661fff6-fd16-4b65-929f-2600e34cd177.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_a1b65202-5986-4052-a059-5353a641409a.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\">酷炫的水下内容：</span></strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_c4dda327-1b02-4314-842c-8d5689cafe78.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_54f1fc51-14b7-4245-8ae9-7a61597caef0.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">有一个残酷模式吗？</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">是的！只需输入 /vestiges enableCruel，你就会明白 BOSS 应该具有怎样的威力了！（不仅仅是 BOSS，饥饿和水下窒息伤害将变得无法阻挡，这样你就可以忽略你酷炫的带有被动天赋和魔法护甲了），怪物有 1% 的概率生成强化状态。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在这种模式下，来自任何模组的 BOSS 都将拥有 x4 的生命值和伤害，100 点护甲值和护甲韧性，90% 的伤害减免，按生命值百分比持续治疗，以及 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9;text-decoration:underline\">护盾</span> 以及 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#843fa1\">超护盾</span>！<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">护盾</span> 以及 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">超护盾</span> 将抵御任何伤害，但它们之间的区别是什么呢？你需要通过命令 /vestiges help 了解 :) 所有的数值和 BOSS 列表都是可配置的，随你所愿。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，所有生物都有很高的几率在随机生成的模组包盔甲中现身，并且你将有权获取此模式下从生物和 BOSS 中获得的一些强力掉落，这使得可以对物品施加负面附魔并超出其限制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_d5b8ecba-f16b-40d9-a28f-e19b161a37cd.png\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_076e1513-e8e4-4d10-8636-659859f2ddfa.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_cf5a8aad-a8b8-4285-9366-dfe5bd58bcb9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">如果某些 BOSS 或生物在挑战中且不可召唤，我应该怎么做？</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以配置任何挑战以降低完成时的最大限制！所有挑战要素仍将按原样计数，只是挑战会更早完成。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">我的模组中不仅有遗迹</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">还有<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">饰品</span></strong>可以提供各种类型的奖励 ^-^</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5657ff26-af2f-49cd-9d31-392038e02744.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_095bb641-31ab-4fbf-9331-5c506c8bf286.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以从那里获得它们</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_812f5c2f-09ff-4d4d-ba66-d15b3d290d5c.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f0f\">虚空漩涡</span></strong>可以使任何物品不会损坏</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_9f4ddcc2-2ac3-4b61-a216-6b13826f4c4f.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">盒子</span></strong>带有随机物品</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_928ee246-a0cb-415a-8979-eebaa7161baf.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_52abdb4d-8a37-4354-8ec5-da491f8a7e59.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_0de9ace0-7d78-4d18-b708-cc419e2d9b11.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_0e21bb8c-bf8c-4042-8714-b5d648939ef0.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>另外还有一个名为 vp-common.toml 的配置，你可以在其中更改很多设置！</strong></h2>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
